flowchart TD
    Start([Document mutation]) --> Validate{Valid request?}
    Validate -- No --> Reject[Return validation error]
    Validate -- Yes --> Persist[Persist source document + job]
    Persist --> Queue[Pending durable queue]
    Queue --> Claim[Claim with processing lease]
    Claim --> Update[Update in-process postings]
    Update --> Stage[Write generation staging file]
    Stage --> Publish[Rename generation and manifest]
    Publish --> Complete[Mark job completed]
    Stage --> Failure{Filesystem failure?}
    Failure -- Yes --> Retry{Attempts remaining?}
    Retry -- Yes --> Queue
    Retry -- No --> Failed[Mark terminal failed]
    Failure -- No --> Publish
    Crash[Worker restart] --> Recover[Return processing jobs to pending]
    Recover --> Queue
